WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.249
Today we will notice how art can carry cultural meaning. Our work connects with our

00:00:05.249 --> 00:00:06.259
own local community.

00:00:07.117 --> 00:00:10.295
Look at a cloth pattern and point to its repeated marks.

00:00:11.117 --> 00:00:14.082
Sketch two repeated shapes from the cloth onto paper.

00:00:15.117 --> 00:00:18.850
Add one personal variation and explain what it represents.
